{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_007.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Ohya and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "You really can't get in anywhere without a[n]reservation. We couldn't even enjoy[n]our tea...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Maybe we shouldn't have gone out...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Nonsense.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's relax.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You're all I need.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "You're always so resolute...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Good idea!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Not even a host would say[n]something like that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "My feet hurt from walking so much.[n]I bet they're gonna be all swollen[n]tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll massage them.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Did you need some ice?[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_005_1_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Make yourself at home.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "...I guess that works.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Thanks!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_005_7_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Ohya[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_005_7_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Oh yeah...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "This is a token of my appreciation.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "You're happy right? Just admit it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I am.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's a great gift.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Well, knowing that you like it[n]makes me happy.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "That's important too, but...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "I heard that Shido is divulging everything.[n]It's like he's a changed man.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Rumor has it that his arrest is imminent.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "And another rumor I heard is that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "The police are gonna make a move[n]to save face. And their target...[n]is the Phantom Thieves.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "They want to make it known that justice[n]is on their side...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "I'm kinda worried...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Ohya stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "...Hm?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_016_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "I see...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "...I'm gonna go.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "No need.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Yup.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "You should know that in my line of work,[n]I always know when someone's hiding[n]something...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "...Thanks for inviting me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ohya",
   "en": "Good night...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Ohya worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}